      "description": "Artificial Intelligence and Data Act",
      "weight": 100,
      "data": {
        "official_name": "Artificial Intelligence and Data Act",
        "common_name": "AIDA",
        "alternate_names": [
          "Part 3 of Bill C-27"
        ],
        "description": "Proposed Canadian federal AI regulation. Part of Bill C-27 (Digital Charter Implementation Act, 2022).",
        "notes": "Status: Died on the Order Paper (44th Parliament, 1st Session; died when the 44th Parliament was prorogued/dissolved in early 2025; verified as of 2026-11-04). Part of Bill C-27 (Digital Charter Implementation Act). Proposes regulation of AI systems in Canada. Includes high-impact AI system requirements: risk assessments, mitigation measures, transparency, record-keeping. Establishes the AI and Data Commissioner.",
