      "weight": 95,
      "data": {
        "official_name": "National Security and Intelligence Review Agency Act",
        "common_name": "NSIRA Act",
        "alternate_names": [
          "Loi sur l'Office de surveillance des activités en matière de sécurité nationale et de renseignement",
          "S.C. 2019, c. 13, s. 2",
          "N-16.62"
        ],
        "description": "Federal statute establishing the National Security and Intelligence Review Agency (NSIRA) with cross-government authority to review any federal department or agency's national security or intelligence activities.",
        "notes": "Status: In force (enacted via Part 1, s. 2 of the National Security Act, 2017, S.C. 2019, c. 13; Justice Laws chapter N-16.62; verified as of 2026-11-03). Requires annual public reports to the Prime Minister tabled in Parliament and statutory annual reviews of CSIS and CSE activities.",
        "urls": [
          {
